  "title": "Greek Lemon-Garlic Chicken Thighs and Potatoes",
  "description": "This simple chicken and potato bake is a great family dinner. Chicken thighs are marinated in a garlic-lemon marinade and then baked in the oven.",
  "authors": [
    "Virginia Vohasek"
